<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="pcb-item-861e503f6f1c49ceaac9e4549c691deb" title="Quick Check: Speculation (usage)" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>A</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float"><qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value></qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        Which sentence uses "speculation" correctly?
    <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">Reports that the two companies will merge are still pure speculation; neither firm has commented, and no documents have surfaced.</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="B">The engineer used a steel speculation to hold the bridge cables in place.</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="C">We watched the speculation set behind the mountains, turning the whole sky orange.</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="D">Her speculation in the school play earned a standing ovation on opening night.</qti-simple-choice>
    </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-A" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct! Speculation means forming theories or guesses without firm evidence, so it's the correct answer because the merger talk has no comments or documents behind it — just unproven guessing.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-B" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Speculation means forming theories or guesses without firm evidence, so it's not the correct choice here because a physical part holding bridge cables would be a 'bracket' or 'clamp' — speculation is an idea, not an object.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-C" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Speculation means forming theories or guesses without firm evidence, so it's not the correct choice here because the thing setting behind the mountains and coloring the sky is the 'sun.'</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-D" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Speculation means forming theories or guesses without firm evidence, so it's not the correct choice here because what earns an ovation in a play is a 'performance,' not a guess.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">A</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-A</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">hidden</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    <qti-response-else-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">B</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-B</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else-if>
    <qti-response-else-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">C</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-C</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else-if>
    <qti-response-else>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-D</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>